# API base URL for the frontend.
#
# Leave UNSET for local Docker development: the frontend falls back to "/api",
# which the nginx proxy routes to the backend container. No change needed.
#
# When deploying the frontend separately from the backend (e.g. frontend static
# site + backend web service on Render, different domains, no proxy in between),
# set this to the full backend URL including the api prefix:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com/api
#
# No trailing slash. Example:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com/api